WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.467 --> 00:00:10.120
I used to do all the work before.

2
00:00:10.121 --> 00:00:16.384
But now I can ask Bada to do it for me.

3
00:00:16.385 --> 00:00:18.533
Mom: I will be gone for a while.

4
00:00:18.534 --> 00:00:22.870
Mom: If someone calls, say, "Can I take a message?"

5
00:00:22.871 --> 00:00:25.197
Here is a pen and paper.

6
00:00:25.198 --> 00:00:27.921
Bada & Hana: Yes, Mom.

7
00:00:27.922 --> 00:00:31.210
Hana: Bada, I have to finish my homework.

8
00:00:31.211 --> 00:00:34.013
You answer the phone, okay?

9
00:00:34.014 --> 00:00:36.156
Bada: Sure. Don't worry.

10
00:00:36.157 --> 00:00:40.007
I can do that.

11
00:00:40.008 --> 00:00:43.070
Bada: Hello, this is the Kangs' residence.

12
00:00:43.071 --> 00:00:46.813
Mr. Kim: Is your Dad home?

13
00:00:46.814 --> 00:00:50.318
Bada: My dad? Nope, he is not home yet.

14
00:00:50.319 --> 00:00:52.061
Can I take a message?

15
00:00:52.062 --> 00:00:55.947
Mr. Kim: That's fine. I will call back.

16
00:00:55.948 --> 00:00:59.414
Bada: Wait! Mom said that I have to take a message.

17
00:00:59.415 --> 00:01:00.804
Mr. Kim: All right, then.

18
00:01:00.805 --> 00:01:02.174
This is Mr. Kim.

19
00:01:02.175 --> 00:01:06.400
Mr. Kim: My number is 378-8907.

20
00:01:06.402 --> 00:01:12.453
Please ask him to call me.

21
00:01:12.454 --> 00:01:19.202
Bada: Mr.Kim. 378-8907.

22
00:01:19.203 --> 00:01:20.218
Is that right?

23
00:01:20.219 --> 00:01:21.862
Mr. Kim: That's right. Bye.

24
00:01:21.863 --> 00:01:26.186
Bada: Thank you. Bye.

25
00:01:26.187 --> 00:01:34.242
Bada always knows how to get exactly what he wants.
